*Jack Pearson*

Graduate Student Researcher (Mechanical Engineering)

*About:* Jack is interested in control theory, specifically in modeling and controlling nonlinear systems. His current research includes modeling and controlling adversarial behavior in population games. Outside of research, he enjoys surfing and ultimate frisbee.

